# The vendored SDK under vendor/space-sdk/ ships its runtime in a
# dist/ folder. That copy is committed source for the packaged
# build, not a build output — re-include it here so the root
# .gitignore's bare `dist/` pattern does not silently drop it from
# the commit (a fresh GitHub checkout must contain it, or the
# Pages workflow build cannot resolve @hatch/space-sdk).
!vendor/space-sdk/dist/
!vendor/space-sdk/dist/**
